{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039640/extras/b1acbce27ee8bbc731486759cb2686a3.avif?t=1759211561\" width=1241 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>To Crown or to Destroy</i></strong> is an aesthetic narrative RPG, filled with  illustrations thoughtfully crafted alongside the plot.\u00a0Face the choice of a fate bound heroine in this hand-drawn tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the free demo, and play the introduction chapter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039640/extras/8daad3db6d294a7813c42ef193dd6757.avif?t=1759211561\" width=1241 height=243 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will accompany the Princess in the last moments before her tragedy: her fate is to live in an eternal Bad Ending...but destiny can always be defied! Face a new inner self, and devour other fairytales' hearts in order to achieve freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As tradition stated, by her 21th birthday the Princess was enrolled as prize for a kingdom-wide competition: everyone could take part in the <strong>Hero's Tournament</strong>, and gain her hand. Such contest could only be won by few chosen ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Nameless Hero</strong> appears before her...and here's where our story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039640/extras/9e551349bb9bedb5552a6388ba05ec79.avif?t=1759211561\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039640/extras/39ac1f201fecbbf47d047aeab6db3c19.avif?t=1759211561\" w